1
00:00:00,869 --> 00:00:02,619
(Penny:)-Hi, guys.
-Hello.

2
00:00:02,787 --> 00:00:03,997
(Penny:)Yo, Raj, talk to me.

3
00:00:12,547 --> 00:00:15,047
(Penny:)I'm sorry, just screwing with you.

4
00:00:17,052 --> 00:00:19,472
(Penny:)Hey, Howard,
why haven't you called Bernadette?

5
00:00:19,637 --> 00:00:20,967
(Howard:)Did she say something?

6
00:00:21,139 --> 00:00:23,809
(Penny:)Said she hasn't heard from you.
I thought you liked her.

7
00:00:24,017 --> 00:00:26,147
I do, you know,
but she wants a commitment...

8
00:00:26,311 --> 00:00:28,641
(Howard:)...and I'm not sure she's my type.

9
00:00:28,813 --> 00:00:31,943
(Penny:)She agreed to go out with you for free.
What more do you need?

10
00:00:32,108 --> 00:00:34,148
(Howard:)Look, Bernadette is really nice.

11
00:00:34,319 --> 00:00:37,779
(Howard:)I just always thought when I finally
settled down into a relationship...

12
00:00:37,947 --> 00:00:40,577
(Howard:)...it would be with someone,
you know, different.

13
00:00:40,742 --> 00:00:42,162
(Penny:)Different how?

14
00:00:42,327 --> 00:00:46,117
(Howard:)Well, you know, more like Megan Fox
from Transformers...

15
00:00:47,248 --> 00:00:50,248
(Howard:)...or Katee Sackhoff
from Battlestar Galactica.

16
00:00:50,919 --> 00:00:52,549
(Penny:)Are you high?

17
00:00:53,838 --> 00:00:59,018
(Leonard:)You'd have a better shot with the
three-breasted Martian from Total Recall.

